        },
        "texto": "Maaloth, “dial,” is the same word that is rendered “degrees” in this verse, and “stairs” in 2 Kings 9:13. This and the parallel passage in Isaiah 38:8 are the only places where the word “dial” occurs. Our translators probably judged correctly in supposing from the context that by…",
